[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3435988517","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111944#issuecomment-3435988517","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111944","id":3435988517,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7MzQYl","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-10-23T09:37:31Z","updated_at":"2025-10-23T09:37:31Z","body":"So this would just fetch the value written to by an out port? `ALPHA` is an `out` uniform in text shaders, it isn't provided as an input value from any functionality like the transparency of a node","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3435988517/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3436091719","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111944#issuecomment-3436091719","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111944","id":3436091719,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7MzplH","user":{"login":"QbieShay","id":7917475,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc5MTc0NzU=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7917475?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/QbieShay","html_url":"https://github.com/QbieShay","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/QbieShay/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/QbieShay/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/QbieShay/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/QbieShay/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/QbieShay/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/QbieShay/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/QbieShay/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/QbieShay/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/QbieShay/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-10-23T09:59:28Z","updated_at":"2025-10-23T09:59:28Z","body":"It should be possible already to fetch vertex stage color with `COLOR.a`\r\n\r\nLike AThousandShips said, ALPHA is an out value in the fragment shader.\r\n\r\nI suspect using it as an input relies on implicit behaviour, which is not good.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3436091719/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3436125013","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111944#issuecomment-3436125013","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111944","id":3436125013,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7MzxtV","user":{"login":"tracefree","id":155747722,"node_id":"U_kgDOCUiFig","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/155747722?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tracefree","html_url":"https://github.com/tracefree","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tracefree/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tracefree/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tracefree/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tracefree/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tracefree/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tracefree/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tracefree/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tracefree/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tracefree/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-10-23T10:08:22Z","updated_at":"2025-10-23T10:11:33Z","body":"As far as I can tell, the [transparency property](https://docs.godotengine.org/en/stable/classes/class_geometryinstance3d.html#class-geometryinstance3d-property-transparency) of GeometryInstance3D directly sets the default value of ALPHA in the fragment shader stage, from a quick test it doesn't seem to affect COLOR in the vertex shader at all. \r\n\r\nFrom the documentation:\r\n> In spatial shaders, 1.0 - transparency is set as the default value of the ALPHA built-in.\r\n\r\nSo while it is documented as being an out value it actually seems to be an inout value since transparency sets it. I don't think there is any other way to get the value set by transparency in a shader.\r\n\r\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3436125013/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3436177905","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111944#issuecomment-3436177905","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111944","id":3436177905,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7Mz-nx","user":{"login":"QbieShay","id":7917475,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc5MTc0NzU=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7917475?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/QbieShay","html_url":"https://github.com/QbieShay","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/QbieShay/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/QbieShay/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/QbieShay/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/QbieShay/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/QbieShay/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/QbieShay/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/QbieShay/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/QbieShay/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/QbieShay/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-10-23T10:21:38Z","updated_at":"2025-10-23T10:21:38Z","body":"Ah, I see.\r\n\r\nIn that case, may I ask you to verify that ALPHA doesn't have random in-values in mobile and compatibility renders?","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3436177905/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3436237405","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111944#issuecomment-3436237405","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111944","id":3436237405,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7M0NJd","user":{"login":"tracefree","id":155747722,"node_id":"U_kgDOCUiFig","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/155747722?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tracefree","html_url":"https://github.com/tracefree","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tracefree/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tracefree/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tracefree/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tracefree/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tracefree/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tracefree/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tracefree/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tracefree/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tracefree/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-10-23T10:39:18Z","updated_at":"2025-10-23T10:39:18Z","body":"I tested it on Mobile and Compatibility. It behaves just as expected: the ALPHA going in is always 1.0 since the transparency property on those renderers is ignored and set to 0.0.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3436237405/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]